notes               = "Untitled in source. The dedication به حمید مصدق ('to Hamid Mosaddegh', ۱۳۱۸-۱۳۷۸ / 1939-1998, the poet and an exact contemporary) is printed in the outer margin. The penultimate line is in guillemets with an asterisk answered under the frame — so that line is Mosaddegh's, not Jafari's; it has been moved out of the body into ===footnotes===. THIS PAGE SETTLES THE PAGE-72 CRUX: line 11 here is printed تُو به تُو with the damma marked on both, meaning 'fold within fold' — exactly the emendation proposed for page 72's در دیوارهای توبه تو, and now attested in the poet's own printed text elsewhere in the book. With the handwritten fair copy in preface/04-coda-from-jafari.html (در دیوارهای تو به توی سایه) that is two independent witnesses; the decision is still Ben's but the case is strong. Line 19's ساق در ساقی تر is uncertain — 'stalk in wetter stalk', or a pun on ساقی, the cupbearer. Bare year ۱۳۷۴ → +621 = 1995. Imported as a draft with machine / lantern layers; ===translation=== left for Ben. Photo check 2026-07-31 (p160): the page prints می‌برد ما را clean — the stray kasra on می‌بردِ was a transcription artifact, removed (a singular verb with the inanimate plural موج‌هایی is the book's own grammar, no emendation needed). The fatha on خوابَ in the quoted Mosaddegh line IS printed — kept as printed."
